HinterOS launcher browser demo: third-party files

The files under assets/demo/ are the content of the browser demo
(lib/web_main.dart). The cover art under art/ is placeholder art drawn by
tool/gen_mock_art.dart (GPL-3.0-only, like the launcher). The files below are
NOT covered by the launcher's license: each stays under the license of its
project, as stated here. They are reproduced unmodified.

Trademarks: the names and logos are those of their projects. The demo shows
them to name the apps; it does not mean that the projects endorse HinterOS.
Firefox is shown by name only (no logo), under the Mozilla trademark policy.
OpenArena and Extreme Tux Racer have no icon: their repositories have none
of their own that the demo can use.


